==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|humbely}}, {{m|enm|humbliche}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|humble|ly}}. {{displaced|ang|ēaþmōdlīċe}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈhʌmbli/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-humbly.ogg|a=US}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In a [[humble]] manner.
#: {{ux|en|I '''humbly''' accept this award.}}
